        prompts: {
          human: 'The 7 of Diamonds is turned. Will you take it as Hokom, or call for the doubling power of Sun? Remember to declare your projects before the second trick, or those points are lost to the desert.',
          ai: 'Game: Baloot. Type: Trick-taking (Belote derivative). Rules: 32 cards. Contracts: Sun (doubled score, no trump) or Hokom (trump). Win last trick (10 pts). Target 152 game points. Projects: Sequences/Sets.',
        },
        scoring: {
          description: 'Points are calculated after all tricks are played. Card points: in Hokom trump J=20, 9=14, A=11, 10=10, K=4, Q=3, 8=0, 7=0; non-trump A=11, 10=10, K=4, Q=3, J=2, 9=0, 8=0, 7=0. Last trick adds 10. Total 162 (Hokom) or 130 (Sun). Convert to game points; first to 152 wins.',
